ps://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53382047?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Onebit5","html_url":"https://github.com/Onebit5","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Onebit5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Onebit5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Onebit5/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Onebit5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Onebit5/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Onebit5/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Onebit5/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Onebit5/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Onebit5/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-07T23:51:22Z","updated_at":"2025-11-07T23:51:22Z","body":"I understand the concern. To clarify, I didn’t use AI to generate this code, all changes were written and tested manually. After closing the PR, I ran additional tests to validate the effect of the `_command_bind_uniform_set()` modifications.\r\n\r\nUsing the TPS template, I measured performance over about one hour of testing (two 30-minute sessions). Results showed an average improvement of roughly 25%, from ~6.0 ms/frame (master) to ~4.5 ms/frame (optimized).\r\n\r\nI’m reopening the PR now that I’ve completed testing and confirmed that the changes produce measurable benefits.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3505404945/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3505525738","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112521#issuecomment-3505525738","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112521","id":3505525738,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Q8hPq","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-08T01:02:34Z","updated_at":"2025-11-08T01:02:34Z","body":"> After closing the PR, I ran additional tests to validate the effect of the _command_bind_uniform_set() modifications.\r\n\r\nWhere did your original performance numbers come from? You claimed that the TPS demo took 18ms on your device and the frame time improved by 3%. Now you say that it takes 6 ms and improved by 25%. \r\n\r\nTo be clear, I do not believe that this PR saves 1.5 ms per frame. You didn't even touch `_command_bind_uniform_set` until after closing the PR. \r\n\r\nFinally, the changes in `_command_bind_uniform_set` don't cover all the additional you made to `uniform_set_create`. Can you explain what those extra changes are and why you added them despite not using them?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3505525738/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]